# FS08 part 2 write regression, QED (#Z C:\Apps\QED\QED.NAP; prep-card.sh qed).
# New text (^N), type "FS08" Return, save (^S -> the AES file selector for an
# untitled text), Esc clears the name field, type QEDT.TXT, Return = save;
# then edit the saved file (type "AB" Return) and save again over it (^S on a
# titled text writes the existing file), quit (^Q).
# Ticks hz_200 after the injector arms = the first EL0 program (the first
# accessory, session start); the application gets 3600 ticks.
# IKBD make codes: Ctrl 1D, N 31, S 1F, Q 10, F 21, 0 0B, 8 09, Return 1C,
# Esc 01, E 12, D 20, T 14, . 34, X 2D, A 1E, B 30; break = make | 0x80.
100 parkbr
3600 mark Q00_UP
3800 key 1D
3810 key 31
3820 key B1
3830 key 9D
4600 mark Q01_NEW
4800 key 21
4806 key A1
4820 key 1F
4826 key 9F
